{"steam_appid":3358170,"steam_name":"Dodo Duckie","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3358170/1737962281/d54adaef81f9b8e41555c4c696832fba9b4df32d/1784803698/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784812318","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257383115/0044489476f888c80606a6023e75a4aaeb97a723/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784812318","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/02180a514ba42bb03d5d2673e7a9124eaec3c971/ss_02180a514ba42bb03d5d2673e7a9124eaec3c971.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786518395","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/3c340834376999b4eaa64fb0818dd84b5c83de7c/ss_3c340834376999b4eaa64fb0818dd84b5c83de7c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786518395","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/6dec6677afab17b6eb12240c6be2f656788896c7/ss_6dec6677afab17b6eb12240c6be2f656788896c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786518395","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/0b4c9bc145b3379d1ed4bb58d4ce9e3df0613754/ss_0b4c9bc145b3379d1ed4bb58d4ce9e3df0613754.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786518395","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/cdee452a8ac6f43ca3fe2e23e192067cc025b975/ss_cdee452a8ac6f43ca3fe2e23e192067cc025b975.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786518395"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quack the code of reality as the clumsy yet courageous duck <strong>Dodo</strong> and traverse bizarre yet charming planets to rescue your kidnapped chicken kin and master impossible new abilities with every waddle to solve puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a lighthearted rescue mission unfurls into a profound, heartfelt journey of self-discovery, where perhaps even a clumsy duck can find a home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/14364cc84e01c1b0a4aa40e3dabc600b.avif?t=1786518395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/14364cc84e01c1b0a4aa40e3dabc600b.webp?t=1786518395 width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a peaceful day on the farm… until a giant alien beam yoinked your chicken family into the sky. With nothing but his waddle, his will, and a very special cap, Dodo dives into a glitched dimension to bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.poster.avif?t=1786518395\" width=1170 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.webm?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.mp4?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/990d1be89015b9eb33101feb99f09392.avif?t=1786518395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/990d1be89015b9eb33101feb99f09392.webp?t=1786518395 width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two dimensions, one adventure. With Capie the Capybara's magical cap, you can flip between side-scrolling and 3rd Person view whenever you like. Swap perspectives to reveal hidden paths and surprise platforms, and use them to crack every puzzle and peek into every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.poster.avif?t=1786518395\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.webm?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.mp4?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/d593c7bbbee267d0c9137c32dc363587.avif?t=1786518395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/d593c7bbbee267d0c9137c32dc363587.webp?t=1786518395 width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodo does a lot more than waddle. Glide over gaps, splash through water, float, flop, and improvise your way through each puzzle. Every move fits into the way you explore, experiment and solve weird little alien puzzles. And yes, there is a dedicated quack button. Hit Q to QUACK, scare some aliens, and calm your own brain at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.poster.avif?t=1786518395\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.webm?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.mp4?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/fb60621222d0447285113f25579420a8.avif?t=1786518395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/fb60621222d0447285113f25579420a8.webp?t=1786518395 width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop from one odd and adorable planet to the next, each stranger and cuter than the last. Collect shiny stardust, uncover secret routes, and meet Capie, the chill shopkeeper who sells very good caps. Don’t forget to take advantage of every very silly photo opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.poster.avif?t=1786518395\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.webm?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.mp4?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e900b0de90a57be598c70dfbebdfe63f.avif?t=1786518395\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/e900b0de90a57be598c70dfbebdfe63f.webp?t=1786518395 width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodo wobbles, trips, and occasionally face-plants, but never gives up on its chicken family. Underneath the clumsy feet is a very determined little heart. Ready to accompany this adorable little duckie? This adventure is full of quacks, caps, and chaos, so grab the hat and jump in. Your next adventure (and your next cute screenshot) is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.poster.avif?t=1786518395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.webm?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.mp4?t=1786518395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (6 GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low Quality setting, 1080p, producing 45 FPS, SSD Required</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (6 GB) / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High Quality setting, 1080p, producing 60 FPS, SSD Required</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["BornMonkie"],"publishers":["Solo Game"],"release_date":"Jul 23, 2026"}